      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While applying the shader to the mirror camera would resolve the \"pierce-through\" issue, it causes visual inconsistencies in Fade processing between the first-person and mirror perspectives. To ensure a consistent experience, I would appreciate it if the rendering order for Translucent Personal Mirrors was unified with Opaque Mirrors.",
