      "value": "Transparency sorting is hard, unfortunately, and your request is not possible to implement. A transparent mirror with alpha values between 0 and 1 exclusive cannot render on the opaque queue or do ZWrite without causing other, more grave issues. I'm closing this as a wontfix.",
